AB  - Coalition structure generation (CSG) is a critical problem in multiagent systems, involving the optimal partitioning of agents into disjoint coalitions to maximize social welfare. This paper introduces SALDAE, a novel multiagent path finding algorithm for CSG on a coalition structure graph. SALDAE employs various heuristics and strategies for efficient search, making it an anytime algorithm suitable for handling large-scale problems.
